   ── Third-party notice ────────────────────────────────────────────────────
   This peer compiles the SQLite amalgamation (sqlite3.c/.h, SQLite 3.50.4) in
   process; SQLite is dedicated to the public domain (https://sqlite.org/copyright.html)
   and no license text applies to it. It links `libentitycore_codec` (Apache-2.0,
   the shared C-ABI codec/crypto floor), which in turn statically + privately
   links libsodium (ISC license, permissive and Apache-2.0-compatible) for
   Ed25519 + SHA-2. Neither SQLite nor libsodium source is redistributed here;
   see https://sqlite.org/ and https://doc.libsodium.org/ for their terms.
